# The build context of the images (docker/java/Dockerfile, docker/keycloak/Dockerfile) is the repository root. Send
# only what they need, so sources, local secrets (.env) and the rest of target/ never reach the Docker daemon.
*
!docker/java/
!docker/keycloak/Dockerfile
!docker/keycloak/taldo-realm.json
!docker/keycloak/configure-realm.sh
!docker/keycloak/start-hosted.sh
!taldo-api/target/taldo-api-*.jar
!taldo-bff/target/taldo-bff-*.jar
